 },
 {
  "id": 7,
  "src_sha256": "1ccd43a99dc5eb4bd38c84c54a6591ac91d70447a960b6293a0b4dced13f80bb",
  "zh": "沒錯， Templar ，一切都照著國王的計畫進行。"
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "src_sha256": "66490d2328270beea84d84a97880a08a7a42e87b22e7e4615b00d080b91da039",
  "zh": "這是你的血，兄弟！"
 },
 {
  "id": 9,
  "src_sha256": "64e8642e6bd1889dea7b06dc891d0921f8e0fdb3521db3e2578cb435537e7acc",
  "zh": "你們會為此付出生命！"
 },
 {
  "id": 10,
  "src_sha256": "31417af38e2ce1f6c0699d7a5a3bcc8c508523603a3731a8ecf8fb7c73f84ad3",
  "zh": "我等這一刻等了好久了……"
 },
 {
  "id": 11,
  "src_sha256": "117781f29d8f7e6f9ae9ca4df15275523039ca5b00b9e2be6e8fb1901699331e",
